16	Display.Conversation	Manor_Steward	The signet! And you came back out again, which is more than the last two did.\Was the old lord's scroll there beside it? The Dread, he called it. He read it at tax collectors. Keep it: it's done its work in this family.\And with the seal in my hand, the law's on my side: the sheriff's men will have those bandits out by nightfall. Come and sit by my fire, any time.	Goodbye, Ambrose.	17
17	Display.Message	Yellow	Quest complete: The Redrock Signet! The manor is Ambrose's again.	Quest
